# Optional MapLibre STYLE URL for the map basemap (Req 20.4).
#
# This must be a MapLibre *style* URL (a style JSON document), NOT a raster
# tile URL like https://tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png.
#
# When this variable is absent, the app builds an inline OpenStreetMap raster
# style at runtime (implemented in Task 13), so no key or configuration is
# required for a working road basemap.
#
# Example (uncomment and set to your own style URL):
# VITE_MAP_STYLE_URL=https://example.com/style.json
